'''Transit Town''' (Japanese: '''ボウゼタウン''' ''Bōze Town'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Johto]], specifically a port town on the northeastern tip of [[Red Rock Isle]]. It has one ferry that goes to [[Olivine City]] and another that goes to [[Silver Rock Isle]].

After visiting [[Diglett Village]] on Red Rock Isle, {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} decided to take the ferry to Silver Rock Isle. They visited the town off-screen at the end of ''[[EP218|Plant It Now... Diglett Later]]'' to take the ferry, but returned in ''[[EP223|Throwing in the Noctowl]]'' to take the ferry to Olivine City. They missed it, however, but met [[Wings Alexander]], a resident of Transit Town and a pilot who was also a skilled Pokémon Trainer in his youth. Wings eventually took them to Olivine City with his plane.

